subtext_notes[], plants[], payoffs[], motifs_present[], registers[], must_feel, pleasure_type, set_piece, set_piece_kind,
must_remember (required when set_piece is true), energy_target, load_bearing, sequence_id, location_reuse, estimated_setups,
special_requirements[], production_flags[], cost_flag, cost_justification, writer_notes[], director_notes[],
